        "passage_id": "P001",
        "quote": "The plaintiff allegedly was injured when she slipped and fell on snow and ice along a snow-covered backyard area on the defendant's premises.",
        "statement_status": "allegation"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "E004",
        "passage_id": "P002",
        "quote": "The plaintiff's deposition testimony established that she had seen the snow and ice condition prior to her fall and that she had stepped off the defendant's cleared driveway to traverse the snow-covered backyard area to access garbage pails in the rear of the premises.",
