        "evidence_id": "E001",
        "passage_id": "P001",
        "quote": "Order, Supreme Court, Bronx County (Kibbie F. Payne, J.), entered May 10, 2011, which denied defendants’ motion for summary judgment dismissing the complaint, unanimously affirmed, without costs.",
