        "quote": "The presence of caution cones here created a triable issue of fact as to prior actual notice of the condition, as defendants’ witness admitted that they would place such caution cones to alert others to a slippery condition and plaintiff denied that the cones were being used to prop open a door, as had been alleged by defendants’ witness",
